OL,6,     FAs the planet's shifting rain
OL,7,     Fpatterns rewrite the rules,
OL,8,     Fsurvival is no longer about
OL,9,     Fstrength alone. From the desert to
OL,10,     Fthe jungle, three mothers face the
OL,11,     Fultimate test of survival as
OL,12,     Fmonsoon floodwaters tear through
OL,13,     Fpygmy elephant territory in
OL,14,     FBorneo, a female platypus in
OL,15,     FAustralia watches a flash flood
OL,16,     Fdestroy her home river, and a
OL,17,     Fflood in Africa brings prey to a
OL,18,     Flone lioness. Andrew Lincoln
OL,19,     Fnarrates
